Subject: [PATCH 2/5] B2: bridge pdf-tool health capability manifest

Adds the four standard touch points for pdf-tool's read-only `health` tool
(live capability/feature-flag/renderer manifest): healthPlatformPdfTool ->
postPdfTool('health', ...) in pdf-tool-client.ts (same projectPayload(grant,
...) shape as every other bridge call), callPdfToolHealth using the existing
site-only resolveTemplateBridgeScope, the `health` tool definition, and its
mcp.ts dispatch case.

